5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look beyond the numbers. Who actually holds the skills to execute this work?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. But I’m worried the grant’s real value is shrinking. We need to see which costs the agency still covers centrally.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
